msgstr "Raqamli transformatsiyani mustahkam asosda quramiz."

msgid "We create practical, secure digital products that businesses can grow with."
msgstr "Bizneslar bilan birga rivojlanadigan amaliy va xavfsiz raqamli mahsulotlar yaratamiz."

msgid "We share personal information only with your consent or when required by law."
msgstr "Shaxsiy ma’lumotlarni faqat roziligingiz bilan yoki qonun talab qilganda ulashamiz."

msgid "We take reasonable measures to protect personal information. It is used only to discuss your project and deliver our services."
