msgid "We use personal information submitted through this website to respond to inquiries and manage projects. Information is processed only for legitimate business purposes and in accordance with applicable law."
msgstr "Sayt orqali yuborilgan shaxsiy ma’lumotlardan murojaatlarga javob berish va loyihalarni boshqarish uchun foydalanamiz. Ma’lumotlar faqat qonuniy biznes maqsadlarida va amaldagi qonunchilikka muvofiq qayta ishlanadi."

